{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach object, take it and do specific task. If not possible, scan for object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <SubTree ID = MobileRobotTask    /> (from previous example)",
